@base = http://localhost:8080
@json = application/json

### 0) Health
GET {{base}}/

### 1) Submit vote: Alice → candidate 3
POST {{base}}/vote
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "id": "abc123",
  "name": "Alice",
  "address": "123 Main St",
  "age": 30,
  "vote": 3
}

### 2) Submit vote: Bob → candidate 3
POST {{base}}/vote
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "id": "def456",
  "name": "Bob",
  "address": "456 Elm St",
  "age": 22,
  "vote": 3
}

### 3) Submit vote: Carol → candidate 1
POST {{base}}/vote
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "id": "ghi789",
  "name": "Carol",
  "address": "789 Oak Ave",
  "age": 28,
  "vote": 1
}

### 4) Get tally (MPC local aggregate)
GET {{base}}/tally

### 5) Inspect party share file (party 0)
GET {{base}}/mpc/party/0

### 6) Chain dump (debug)
GET {{base}}/chain

### (Optional) CORS preflight check for /vote
OPTIONS {{base}}/vote
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type
